2026-07-27T12:01:44.9213314Z i /tmp/RtmpJjiCAq/duckdb
2026-07-27T12:01:44.9213660Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T12:01:44.9214053Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T12:01:44.9214405Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T12:01:44.9214944Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T12:01:44.9215744Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T12:01:44.9216778Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
